decision 194, decision 126: canon-fp has no Define form, so a value holding a define record has no fingerprint for emit json, whatever other emit the package has.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A rule.
record Rule {
  /// A define.
  it: Define
}

/// The rule.
let rule: Rule = { it: { value: 3 } }

emit json { out: "out/" }
-- findings.txt --
error[E8151]  a/a.canon:10:5
  value rule is a load.defines table or record, which has no wire form

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
